949 0 obj
<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Flowchart outlining a machine learning-driven CI/CD pipeline with five stages: Sense \(code changes, test execution, environment conditions, dependencies\), Analyze \(pattern recognition, anomaly detection, risk profiling\), Predict \(failure prediction, risk assessment, time estimation\), Act \(selective execution, intelligent retries, rollout control\), and Learn \(model retraining, strategy refinement, feedback integration\). Arrows connect stages in a cyclical process.) /K 994 0 R /P 278 0 R /Pg 263 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
950 0 obj
<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Diagram illustrating a five-layer architecture for AI-augmented CI/CD. Layers from bottom to top include Data and Observability, Reliability Intelligence, Predictive Modeling, Adaptive Execution, and Human AI Collaboration, each containing distinct modules. Arrows indicate actions, continuous learning feedback loop, and a right-side vertical data flow labeled Sense, Analyze, Predict, Act, and Act plus Learn.) /K 995 0 R /P 278 0 R /Pg 265 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
